      <activity id="023e172c-e9ca-5e4e-b100-8207e037bd76" activityNameId="ba317639-66cb-5548-8c07-a5f2c5c59b15" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Perlite, at mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Perlite, at mine
As no data are available, data from vermiculite mining are copied. Uncertainties are raised accordingly.;
UUID: 639c13e1-890e-3328-b62d-edb584020be3
includes excavation by digger, blasting, transportation within mine, the land-use of the mine, the recultivation and dust emissions
Location: For the exchanges, RER, GLO and CH modules have been used as proxy.
Technology: Technology of vermiculite mining used.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data adapted from module "vermiculite, at mine" based on literature 
Extrapolations: data which are only available for GLO, RER and CH have been used as proxy for D
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_639c13e1-890e-3328-b62d-edb584020be3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
